slug: durable-waiting-on-a-person
what: Durable journals intent first and hands recorded answers back on
  recovery, so an Entry with no answer is structurally a question
  asked and not yet answered - but every missing answer is currently
  read as the crash window. Give it the other reading: an operation
  whose answer comes from OUTSIDE the program parks instead of
  failing, and resumes when the answer is journalled. The suspension
  conversation-runtime needs.
touches: okay-agent/src/main/scala/okay/agent/Durable.scala,
  okay-agent/src/test/scala/okay/agent/TestDurable.scala,
  specs/llm-agentic.md, BACKLOG.md
